sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guard as AGENTGUARD Policy Engine
    participant Queue as Approval Center Queue
    participant UI as Approval Center UI Card
    actor User as Human Owner
    participant Orch as Payment Orchestrator

    Guard->>Queue: Intent Evaluated -> REVIEW (15m TTL)
    Queue->>UI: Real-Time WebSocket Card Push
    User->>UI: Inspects Card & XAI Trace -> Clicks "APPROVE"
    UI->>Queue: POST /api/v1/approvals/appr_123/action (APPROVE)
    Queue->>Orch: Issue Signed Authorization Token & Trigger Execution
